  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "notes": "Sprint 1-3 scaffold sub-workflow. Input contract: workflow_run_id, video_json, title, description, thumbnail. Human Approval uses the backend's REAL, already-built /approvals endpoints (create checkpoint -> poll every 5 min via a Wait node -> branch on the recorded action) \u2014 nothing AI-driven here, just data plumbing. YouTube Upload uses n8n's real native YouTube node plus a direct call to the YouTube Data API's thumbnails.set endpoint, both with PLACEHOLDER, unconfigured OAuth2 credentials since no Google Cloud project/credential has been set up yet. Reading the video file assumes local disk storage (STORAGE_BACKEND=local) and will need adjusting for S3/R2. Output contract: video_url, youtube_video_id, publish_status."
  },
